.TH stool 1  "stool 1.0.0"
.SH NAME
stool \- Developer environment, dotfiles and offline key backups
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Developer environment, dotfiles and offline key backups
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show more debugging information
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
stool\-init(1)
Save dotfiles defaults, initialize Apple settings and optionally restore offline keys
.TP
stool\-dotfile(1)
Manage dotfiles from a Git repository
.TP
stool\-secrets(1)
Back up and restore GPG and SSH keys independently of dotfiles
.TP
stool\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions from the current command definitions
.TP
stool\-man(1)
Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.TP
stool\-apple(1)
Manage macOS preferences and Homebrew independently of dotfiles
.TP
stool\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v1.0.0
